{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "f1cbeff83baa690409344e333303d8fb4c9bc36298843f513a9c3c0f30240fb9", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-f1cbeff83baa69040934", "filename": "C1.mp3", "sha256": "f1cbeff83baa690409344e333303d8fb4c9bc36298843f513a9c3c0f30240fb9", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/f1cbeff83baa690409344e333303d8fb4c9bc36298843f513a9c3c0f30240fb9.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/f1cbeff83baa690409344e333303d8fb4c9bc36298843f513a9c3c0f30240fb9.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1RTCgPQXPfPBb9cHIgQAVfTz0wyw_zygE-C-0-recording-f1cbeff83baa", "label": "Jahshan set 9 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [111, 112], "questions": [{"number": 31, "prompt": "Dr Dean says that patients with tennis elbow\nA may be unaware that they have the condition at first.\nB tend to come from a remarkably narrow range of occupations.\nC can easily avoid the condition by adopting correct working practices.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "In the physiotherapy programme used in Dr Dean’s trial,\nA the treatment given was tailored to the needs of each patient.\nB patients had to build up their strength before starting it.\nC some patients found the treatment too painful.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "What does Dr Dean say about the role of ‘smart rest’ in the trial?\nA It wasn’t appropriate for certain types of tennis elbow.\nB It formed the basis of two of the three treatment options.\nC It kept all patients physically active despite the condition.", "sourcePage": 111, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "What did Dr Dean find interesting about the results of the trial?\nA They were surprisingly conclusive in the short term.\nB They underlined the advantages of timely intervention.\nC They confirmed the findings of an earlier piece of research.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "Dr Dean would advise anyone experiencing tennis elbow for more than three months to\nA avoid using any steroid-based medication at that point.\nB be ready to start more invasive forms of treatment.\nC try a combination of physiotherapy and injections.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Dr Dean suggests that taking anti-inflammatories for tennis elbow\nA is less effective than alternative forms of medication.\nB is trying to treat a symptom that may not actually exist.\nC is an area that needs to be researched more thoroughly.\nNow look at extract two.\n\nExtract 2: Questions 37-42\nYou hear a presentation in which a researcher called Dr Sarah Jones is talking on the subject of weight loss\ninterventions by GPs.\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 112, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 116, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["f1cbeff83baa690409344e333303d8fb4c9bc36298843f513a9c3c0f30240fb9"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Matching sound verified in three separated windows; excerpt questions restricted to the spoken question range", "referenceRecordingSha256": "e88c823b938e36786f60a11e553fc99705867b9a3957de159fb72db4352f40d1"}]}
